{"slug":"spot-x","title":"SPOT X","desc":"This compact satellite SOS alarm protects remote-location workers via two-way satellite communications providing protection in areas with no mobile signal.​","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/spot-x-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Satellite Communication Device\",\"title\":\"SPOT X\",\"intro\":\"Give your team a device capable of two-way satellite communications providing protection in areas with no mobile signal.​\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/spot-x-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Help/SPOT Assist\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safety wherever you are\",\"heading\":\"Help/SPOT Assist\",\"content\":\"Users can request help from an allocated contact at their current GPS location.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-x-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Long-lasting battery\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Battery.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Power that lasts\",\"heading\":\"Long-lasting battery\",\"content\":\"Complete a whole working week without worrying about the device’s charge. Up to 10 days usage on a single set of lithium batteries.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-x-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"2-Way Communication\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/two-way-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Send and receive messages\",\"heading\":\"2-Way Communication\",\"content\":\"Send and receive messages and data via satellite remotely even where there is no mobile signal available.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-x-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"IP67-rated\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Waterproof.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Waterproof and dustproof\",\"heading\":\"IP67-rated\",\"content\":\"IP67-rated robust casing makes SPOT X durable and reduces the need to replace damaged devices. Protection against dust, rain, splashing and accidental submersion for 30 minutes in up to 1 metre of water.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-x-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Log activity\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/log-activity-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Check-in\",\"heading\":\"Log activity\",\"content\":\"Staff can check in and out of their working day or extend activities, providing updates on their wellbeing.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-x-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Satellite communication\",\"title\":\"2-way messaging\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/spotx-messaging-mobile-crop-1024x578.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SPOT X is an essential piece of kit for <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/\">lone workers</a> or groups in remote and rural areas, helping them to stay connected beyond the boundaries of reliable cellular service by providing two-way satellite messaging communication.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mobile Pairing<br></strong>Users can now operate seamlessly between network coverage and no network cover, by combining the SPOT X with our <a href=\"/products/standard-mobile/\">standard mobile</a> system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a user sets a timed activity on their mobile and moves into an area with no network coverage, they can cancel or extend their timer using their SPOT device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/13/2\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the SPOT X can enhance the safety and security of your workers in areas of no signal?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how SPOT X provides reliable protection and two-way communication to ensure your employees are protected even without network connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/13/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a SPOT X demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3qr\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:spot-gen4@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:standard-mobile@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:twig-ex-atex@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":11,"types":["safety-devices"]}